  "documents": [
    "The party investigates the ruins of the fallen citadel, uncovering remnants of the empire’s once-glorious banners. Tensions rise as faint echoes of magic hum through the halls.",
    "After uncovering the sigil of the old emperor, the group debates whether to disturb the sealed chamber beneath the citadel. Strange whispers grow louder.",
    "The crew lands on the rocky shoreline of the Shattered Coast. Rumors of a dragon’s hoard buried in the cliffs draw the adventurers inland.",
    "Inside a cliffside cavern, the group discovers ancient draconic carvings hinting at a buried treasure—and a curse that still lingers."
  ],
